{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:25-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.SAVINGS.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["hu"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["K\u00e9rj\u00fck, a t\u00f6rl\u00e9shez haszn\u00e1lja a backspace billenty\u0171t."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["A bal, fel \u00e9s le ny\u00edlbillenty\u0171k letiltva. A home, end, pgup \u00e9s pgdn billenty\u0171k szint\u00e9n."],"Use backspace to delete.":["A t\u00f6rl\u00e9shez haszn\u00e1lja a backspace billenty\u0171t."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Ha az \u00e9rt\u00e9k ki van v\u00e1lasztva, csak kezdje el az \u00faj \u00e9rt\u00e9k be\u00edr\u00e1s\u00e1t a kor\u00e1bbi \u00e9rt\u00e9k t\u00f6rl\u00e9s\u00e9hez."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Ha egy sz\u00e1m ki van jel\u00f6lve (az \u00e9rt\u00e9k inverzben jelenik meg), a jobb oldali ny\u00edlbillenty\u0171vel t\u00f6r\u00f6lheti a kijel\u00f6l\u00e9st az \u00e9rt\u00e9k t\u00f6rl\u00e9se n\u00e9lk\u00fcl. Ezut\u00e1n a szerkeszt\u00e9shez l\u00e9pjen vissza."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["TIPP: \u00c1ltal\u00e1ban a legjobb a TAB vagy a SHIFT-TAB billenty\u0171ket haszn\u00e1lni az egyik bevitelr\u0151l a k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 vagy az el\u0151z\u0151 bevitelre val\u00f3 \u00e1tt\u00e9r\u00e9shez."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["TIPP 2: \u00c1ltal\u00e1ban az \u00e9rt\u00e9k szerkeszt\u00e9se nem hat\u00e9kony. Mivel az \u00e9rt\u00e9kek automatikusan kiv\u00e1laszt\u00f3dnak, csak \u00edrja be a k\u00edv\u00e1nt sz\u00e1mot."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Ne \u00edrja be az ezer elv\u00e1laszt\u00f3 karaktert."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Ha az amerikai konvenci\u00f3t haszn\u00e1lja, az a vessz\u0151 lenne.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["El\u00e9g okos vagyok ahhoz, hogy be\u00edrjam \u0151ket helyetted!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Ismeretlen d\u00e1tumsz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00e1si hiba t\u00f6rt\u00e9nt."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["K\u00e9rj\u00fck, adja meg nek\u00fcnk a bemeneteket \u00e9s a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sokat, hogy ezt meg tudjuk jav\u00edtani. K\u00f6sz\u00f6nj\u00fck."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["A d\u00e1tum nem \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes - rossz \u00e9v."],"Jan":["jan."],"Feb":["febr."],"Mar":["m\u00e1rc."],"Apr":["\u00e1pr."],"May":["m\u00e1jus"],"Jun":["j\u00fan."],"Jul":["j\u00fal."],"Aug":["aug."],"Sept":["szept."],"Oct":["okt."],"Nov":["nov."],"Dec":["dec."],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Hiba: a d\u00e1tumok nem a megfelel\u0151 sorrendben vannak."],"Exception":["Kiv\u00e9tel"],"occurred when accessing":["t\u00f6rt\u00e9nt, amikor a"],"Invalid index":["\u00c9rv\u00e9nytelen index"],"YTD":["\u00c9v eleje"],"Running Totals":["Kumul\u00e1lt \u00f6sszegek"],"Your Personalized Savings Schedule":["Az \u00d6n szem\u00e9lyre szabott megtakar\u00edt\u00e1si \u00fctemez\u00e9se"],"Cash Flow Summary":["Cash flow \u00f6sszegz\u00e9s"],"Total Savings":["\u00d6sszes megtakar\u00edt\u00e1s"],"Number of Investments":["Befektet\u00e9sek sz\u00e1ma"],"Return on Investment (ROI)":["Befektet\u00e9s megt\u00e9r\u00fcl\u00e9se (BM)"],"Total Gain":["Teljes nyeres\u00e9g"],"Last Cash Flow Date":["Utols\u00f3 cash flow d\u00e1tuma"],"Years":["\u00c9vek"],"Savings Schedule":["Megtakar\u00edt\u00e1si \u00fctemez\u00e9s"],"Year":["\u00c9v"],"Date":["D\u00e1tum"],"Deposit":["Bet\u00e9t"],"Interest":["Kamat"],"Net Change":["Nett\u00f3 v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1s"],"Balance":["Egyenleg"],"Annual Savings":["\u00c9ves megtakar\u00edt\u00e1s"],"Annual Interest":["\u00c9ves kamat"],"Change in Balance":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00e1s az egyenlegben"],"Annual Savings and Interest Totals":["\u00c9ves megtakar\u00edt\u00e1s \u00e9s kamat \u00f6sszesen"],"Accumulated Savings and Interest":["Felhalmozott megtakar\u00edt\u00e1s \u00e9s kamat"],"Amount Saved & Interest as Percentage of Total Value":["Megtakar\u00edtott \u00f6sszeg \u00e9s kamat az \u00f6ssz\u00e9rt\u00e9k sz\u00e1zal\u00e9k\u00e1ban"],"Running Investment":["Kumul\u00e1lt befektet\u00e9s"],"Running Savings":["Folyamatos megtakar\u00edt\u00e1s"],"Running Interest":["Kumul\u00e1lt kamat"],"Total Deposits":["\u00d6sszes bet\u00e9t"],"Total Interest Earned":["\u00d6sszes kamatj\u00f6vedelem"],"Total Value":["\u00d6sszes \u00e9rt\u00e9k"],"Pct. of Total":["\u00d6sszes sz\u00e1zal\u00e9ka"],"Number of Deposits":["Bet\u00e9tek sz\u00e1ma"],"Interest Rate":["Kamatl\u00e1b"],"Total Interest":["Teljes kamat"],"\"Net Change\" is change from prior period i.e. prior balance plus deposit, plus interest less withdrawal.":["A \"nett\u00f3 v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1s\" az el\u0151z\u0151 id\u0151szakhoz k\u00e9pest bek\u00f6vetkezett v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1s, azaz a kor\u00e1bbi egyenleg plusz befizet\u00e9s, plusz kamat, m\u00ednusz kivon\u00e1s."],"Annual Deposit and Interest Totals":["\u00c9ves bet\u00e9t \u00e9s kamat \u00f6sszesen"],"Accumulated Deposit and Interest":["Felhalmozott bet\u00e9t \u00e9s kamat"],"Annual Deposit":["\u00c9ves befizet\u00e9s"],"Running Deposit":["\u00d6sszes\u00edtett bet\u00e9t"],"Savings Calculator \u2014 calculate future value":["Megtakar\u00edt\u00e1si kalkul\u00e1tor - sz\u00e1molja ki a j\u00f6v\u0151beli \u00e9rt\u00e9ket"],"<p>This calculator easily answers the question \"If I save \"X\" amount for \"Y\" months what will the value be at the end?\"<\/p>":["<p>Ez a kalkul\u00e1tor k\u00f6nnyed\u00e9n megv\u00e1laszolja a k\u00e9rd\u00e9st: \"Ha megtakar\u00edtok \"X\" \u00f6sszeget \"Y\" h\u00f3napra, mi lesz az \u00e9rt\u00e9ke a v\u00e9g\u00e9n?\"<\/p>"],"<p>The user enters the \"Periodic Savings Amount\" (amount saved or invested every month); the \"Number of Months\" and the \"Annual Interest Rate\" or the annual rate of return one expects to earn on their investments.<\/p>":["<p>A felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3 megadja a \"Rendszeres megtakar\u00edt\u00e1si \u00f6sszeget\" (havonta megtakar\u00edtott vagy befektetett \u00f6sszeg); a \"H\u00f3napok sz\u00e1m\u00e1t\" \u00e9s az \"\u00c9ves kamatl\u00e1bat\" vagy a v\u00e1rhat\u00f3 \u00e9ves hozamot a befektet\u00e9seire.<\/p>"],"<p>The calculator quickly creates a savings schedule and a set of charts that will help the user see the relationship between the amount invested and the return on the investment.<\/p>":["A kalkul\u00e1tor gyorsan l\u00e9trehoz egy megtakar\u00edt\u00e1si \u00fctemez\u00e9st \u00e9s egy sor diagramot, amely seg\u00edti a felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3t abban, hogy l\u00e1ssa a befektetett \u00f6sszeg \u00e9s a befektet\u00e9s hozama k\u00f6z\u00f6tti kapcsolatot."],"<p>The investment term is always expressed in months.<\/p>":["<p>A befektet\u00e9si id\u0151t mindig h\u00f3napokban fejezz\u00fck ki.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 h\u00f3nap = &nbsp;5 \u00e9v<\/li><li>120 h\u00f3nap = 10 \u00e9v<\/li><li>180 h\u00f3nap = 15 \u00e9v<\/li><li>240 h\u00f3nap = 20 \u00e9v<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 h\u00f3nap = 30 \u00e9v<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Savings Calculator\" - one that lets the user solve for the starting amount, the amount to invest, the interest rate, the term required to reach a goal or the future value; or if you would like to easily print the schedule; or if you need to pick a different investment frequency, then you may want to try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Ha egy fejlettebb \"Megtakar\u00edt\u00e1si Kalkul\u00e1torra\" van sz\u00fcks\u00e9ge - olyanra, amely lehet\u0151v\u00e9 teszi a felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3nak, hogy kisz\u00e1molja a kezd\u0151 \u00f6sszeget, a befektetend\u0151 \u00f6sszeget, a kamatl\u00e1bat, a c\u00e9l el\u00e9r\u00e9s\u00e9hez sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges id\u0151t vagy a j\u00f6v\u0151beli \u00e9rt\u00e9ket; vagy ha k\u00f6nnyed\u00e9n szeretn\u00e9 kinyomtatni az \u00fctemez\u00e9st; vagy ha m\u00e1s befektet\u00e9si gyakoris\u00e1got szeretne v\u00e1lasztani, akkor \u00e9rdemes kipr\u00f3b\u00e1lnia a k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 kalkul\u00e1tort: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Savings Calculator\" - one that lets the user solve for the starting amount, the amount to invest, the interest rate, the term required to reach a goal or the future value; or if you need to pick a different investment frequency, then you may want to try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Ha egy fejlettebb \"Megtakar\u00edt\u00e1si Kalkul\u00e1torra\" van sz\u00fcks\u00e9ge - olyanra, amely lehet\u0151v\u00e9 teszi a felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3nak, hogy kisz\u00e1molja a kezd\u0151 \u00f6sszeget, a befektetend\u0151 \u00f6sszeget, a kamatl\u00e1bat, a c\u00e9l el\u00e9r\u00e9s\u00e9hez sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges id\u0151t vagy a j\u00f6v\u0151beli \u00e9rt\u00e9ket; vagy ha k\u00f6nnyed\u00e9n szeretn\u00e9 kinyomtatni az \u00fctemez\u00e9st; vagy ha m\u00e1s befektet\u00e9si gyakoris\u00e1got szeretne v\u00e1lasztani, akkor \u00e9rdemes kipr\u00f3b\u00e1lnia a k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 kalkul\u00e1tort: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Sz\u00e1m\u00e1ra"],"Address":["C\u00edm"],"City, State  ZIP":["V\u00e1ros, Megye  Ir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00f3sz\u00e1m"],"Prepared On":["El\u0151k\u00e9sz\u00edt\u00e9s d\u00e1tuma"],"Prepared by":["El\u0151k\u00e9sz\u00edt\u0151 neve"],"Phone":["Telefon"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Weboldal"],"Unknown":["Ismeretlen"],"u":["i"],"U":["I"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["A d\u00e1tumoknak a h\u00f3nap els\u0151 napj\u00e1nak kell lenni\u00fck."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["\u00c9rv\u00e9nytelen JavaScript d\u00e1tumobjektum."],"Monthly":["Havi"]}}}